{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1205373-madletter-s-dragon-blooded-charm-cascades","id":1205373,"title":"MadLetter's Dragon-Blooded Charm Cascades","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-10T14:53:33-07:00","id":1205373,"title":"MadLetter's Dragon-Blooded Charm Cascades","content":"Hello folks!<br /> <br /> It's this time again! With access to the first few parts of the Charms chapter from the Kickstarter, I already set out to work on the Dragon-Blooded cascades.<br /> <br /> As per usual I will focus my updates on reddit, easily found here: <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/exalted/comments/8barde/madletters_dragonblooded_cascades/\" target=\"_blank\">Link</a><br /> <br /> At the moment, I have finished the first cascade, and I will try to get one up per day at least (day-job work being relatively demanding at the moment) until the weekend rolls around. And here's the quick link list:<ul><li>Archery - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_archery.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Athletics - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_athletics.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Awareness - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_awareness.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Brawl - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_brawl.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Bureaucracy - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_bureaucracy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Craft - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_craft.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Dodge - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_dodge.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Integrity - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_integrity.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Investigation - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_investigation.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Larceny - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_larceny.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Linguistics - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_linguistics.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Lore - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_lore.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Medicine - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_medicine.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Melee - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_melee.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Occult - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_occult.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Performance - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_performance.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Presence - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_presence.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Resistance - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_resistance.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Ride - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_ride.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Sail - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_sail.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> <li>Socialize - <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/db_v1/cascade_db_v1_socialize.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></li> </ul><br /> Let me know what you think. I'll be more regularly looking into things over at reddit, but I'll check back here too.<br /> <br /> Cheers, folks!<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> <b>Addition</b>: I have set up a GoogleDoc for people to leave feedback in case I typo something or accidentially fall prone to other errors. At the end of the document there is also a place to leave likewise input on the Solar cascades. I lost a lot of the feedback given earlier to me due to an HDD crash, so if you wanna help go ahead and gimme that input! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":322,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","user":"MadLetter","date":". 05-15-2018, 05:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":30}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-10T20:03:53-07:00","id":1205447,"title":"","content":"Fantastic!<br /> <br /> Just a minor microscopic question: did you think of using white for the Earth signature's border? I think you didn't used it because probably the name of the charms wouldn't read very well given the light yellow background. While I understand why you chose brown, my inner Exalted purist (which should not be taken very seriously) wanted to see the classical elemental colors.<br /> <br /> But this doesn't mean it's a problem or that I dissaprove in any way. Your charm trees have been an incredible aid for me and my players. Thanks for doing this!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-10T20:55:42-07:00","id":1205455,"title":"","content":"Nice! Indicating the Balanced keyword along with Elements and Aura would be helpful. A scale pan symbol would seem appropriate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":487,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","user":"Greyman","date":". 04-10-2018, 11:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-10T23:54:32-07:00","id":1205479,"title":"","content":"Quick nitpick: neither Earth's Jugment Awakened nor Fang-of-the-Depths Draw is Aura Keyworded (which make those two Charms at least usable).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3657-sagara","name":"Sagara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3657_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-11T00:51:22-07:00","id":1205488,"title":"","content":"You are hereby rewarded with over 9000 internet point","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-11T14:12:07-07:00","id":1205750,"title":"","content":"Eyyy, nice. OVER NINE... aehm.<br /> <br /> Anyways, I've done Athletics today, see main post for link.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the input so far, guys. Athletics has a Balanced indicator now. Using the Exalted-Colorscheme doesn't quite work out for the elements, sadly, since black is already used, as is white. I may try some ideas, but this is most likely the color scheme I will use for now. I will fix Archery tomorrow, focused on getting a new cascade out for today, had a bit of a hard workday.<br /> <br /> Cheers and till tomorrow for Awareness!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-13T16:29:36-07:00","id":1206719,"title":"","content":"More things added, Brawl is up. Did some fixes here and there, let me know if you folks find anything else! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]