r/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T08:28:34-07:00","id":1207993,"title":"","content":"Thanks for all the kind words, folks! I am happily working away at the cascades when I get the time, but for now I am stuck doing them after work. Come the 28th - if I should be unable to finalize them till then - I will have more time, two weeks of time off from work.<br /> <br /> If you wanna help me out, make note of any typos, errors, etc. on the GoogleDocs file I use:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ty659II73l42wbRLd6guywfL_dx-RQqisHbM7TIa3L8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ty659II73l42wbRLd6guywfL_dx-RQqisHbM7TIa3L8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ty659II73l42wbRLd6guywfL_dx-RQqisHbM7TIa3L8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ty659II73l42wbRLd6guywfL_dx-RQqisHbM7TIa3L8/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Note <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2746_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2746\" data-vbnamecard=\"2746\">TGUEIROS</a> that the file contains a section for the Solar cascades. Once I am done with the DB ones, I wanna go and fix all the issues remaining with the Solar ones. While back I lost a lot of the &quot;to do&quot; list for those cascades to an HDD crunch, so this time around Ima be safe and just put it up in the cloudy heights. Thanks for your efforts and look forward to me posting more cascades!<br /> <br /> Note: I will only update this post every couple cascades to avoid spamming. Normally I should get at least one Cascade done per day. Cheers folks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T17:04:55-07:00","id":1208249,"title":"","content":"Thanks a lot for doing this. Looking forward to the rest now that the other half of the Charms chapter dropped.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-18T13:28:22-07:00","id":1208549,"title":"","content":"First one from the new batch! Larceny is going up!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T01:56:10-07:00","id":1209561,"title":"","content":"These are great! Very easy to read. I was trying to see what charms of other elements were in each ability, which is quite time-consuming to work out, but these make it much easier to see at a glance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T04:37:05-07:00","id":1209576,"title":"","content":"Nice, that means I have achieved one of my main objectives!<br /> (Easy and at-a-glance identification of elemental affiliations, that is)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T04:53:31-07:00","id":12095