":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"90"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T12:44:58-07:00","id":1214736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DraMaFlo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1205373-madletter-s-dragon-blooded-charm-cascades?p=1214590#post1214590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think making the elemental tokens bigger would help a lot. They're hard to distinguish when you're zoomed back</div> </div> </div> </div>I may try it out, but I like the relatively clean look it has so far. Unless you're all the way zoomed out they should generally be identifiable. I'll give it a whirl and see how it looks!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> May I ask what program you use to make these? </div> </div> </div>Adobe Illustrator. Work of warning, though, I do work in the graphics and design industry and thus have paid access to the program. If you're unsure or unwilling to spring the (consderable) price-tag, you may want to check out free alternatives, like Inkscape. Any solid Vector-based graphics tool should do the trick, I'd say!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T22:16:02-07:00","id":1214915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MadLetter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1205373-madletter-s-dragon-blooded-charm-cascades?p=1214736#post1214736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Adobe Illustrator. Work of warning, though, I do work in the graphics and design industry and thus have paid access to the program. If you're unsure or unwilling to spring the (consderable) price-tag, you may want to check out free alternatives, like Inkscape. Any solid Vector-based graphics tool should do the trick, I'd say!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, I'll look into Inkscape.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5280-gfrobbin84","name":"gfrobbin84","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"90"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T11:30:07-07:00","id":1215866,"title":"","content":"I'm back! Didn't get anything done the last two days, largely because I now finally get to ST Exalted again with my group. Whoo! Been nearly a year without! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Anyways.... Resistance is up!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","